From 807a67b78f8aaa575e8ef5bfa241f1ee5b90e886 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tobias Musser <19334922+P2ppyJack@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:12:58 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat(journey): provider memory nodes, star-map provenance,
 search and recall

Add optional best-effort memory-provider hooks and Honcho support.

Expose provider cards and source sessions while keeping provider nodes read-only.

Add provenance drill-down, provider-session materialization, search and filters, /recall composer drafts, and share-code v4 with v3 decoding.

Add backend and desktop behavior coverage.
